<section class="foyer" id="foyer">
  <div class="foyer-card">
    <div class="acronym-top">Eisner Advisory Group LLC &middot; National Tax Office &middot; Accounting Methods &amp; Periods</div>

    <div class="foyer-screen" id="introScreen">
      <div class="hello">
        <span class="unicorn-mark large" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="" role="presentation">
        </span>
        <p class="landing-eyebrow">UNIPRO</p>
        <h2>UNIFORM CAPITALIZATION CALCULATOR</h2>
        <p class="nto-line">Prepare and document Simplified Production Method, Modified Simplified Production Method, and Simplified Resale Method calculations under Section 263A.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="foyer-options">
        <button class="foyer-link" type="button" onclick="showBackground()">Background</button>
        <span class="foyer-divider"></span>
        <button class="foyer-link" type="button" onclick="startNewWorkpaper()">Get started</button>
      </div>
      <div class="how-to-row">
        <button class="secondary" type="button" onclick="startHowToUse()">How to use</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foyer-screen hidden" id="backgroundScreen">
      <div class="copy">
        <h3>Background</h3>
        <p>UNIPRO supports producer computations under the Simplified Production Method and Modified Simplified Production Method, and reseller computations under the Simplified Resale Method.</p>
        <p>Users paste account-level amounts, confirm what each account represents, and compare the amount of additional Section 263A costs capitalized to ending inventory under each method.</p>
        <p>UNIPRO is a computational workpaper. This version prepares eligible FIFO results and integrates completed LIFO pool or grouping schedules into the SPM and MSPM calculations. It does not calculate a taxpayer's LIFO index or determine whether a taxpayer is required or permitted to use a method, whether a method change is required, or whether any election or procedural requirement has been satisfied.</p>
        <p>Created by <a href="mailto:jaime.garciadeparedes@eisneramper.com">Jaime Garcia de Paredes</a>, <a href="mailto:anthony.digiacinto@eisneramper.com">Anthony DiGiacinto</a>, and <a href="mailto:briauna.williams-henderson@eisneramper.com">Briauna Williams-Henderson</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bottom">
        <button class="secondary" type="button" onclick="showIntro()">Back</button>
        <button class="primary" type="button" onclick="startNewWorkpaper()">Continue</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

