      <div class="stage-stack">
  <section class="card workflow-stage stage-active" data-step="1" data-tour="setup">
    <div class="card-head">
      <div class="card-title-status"><h2>1. Enter Taxpayer Information</h2><span id="step1Status" class="pill warn">Not started</span></div>
      <button class="ghost" type="button" onclick="resetAll()">Reset</button>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="setup-grid">
        <div class="setup-field">
          <label for="clientName">Taxpayer name</label>
          <input id="clientName" placeholder="Taxpayer name" autocomplete="organization">
        </div>
        <div class="setup-field">
          <label for="taxYear">Tax year ending</label>
          <input id="taxYear" placeholder="12/31/2025">
        </div>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide">
          <legend>Taxpayer is a</legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="activityType" value="producer"><span>Producer</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="activityType" value="reseller"><span>Reseller</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="activityType" value="producerReseller"><span>Producer and reseller</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide" id="unicapHistoryControls">
          <legend>Did the taxpayer capitalize additional Section 263A costs on last year's federal return? <button type="button" class="setup-help-link row-action-link row-definition-link" onmouseenter="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onmouseleave="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" onfocus="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onblur="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" data-definition-label="What this question means" data-definition="Answer Yes if the taxpayer included additional Section 263A costs in inventory on last year's federal return. It does not ask whether the taxpayer used UNIPRO." aria-describedby="selectionDefinitionTooltip">What this means</button></legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="unicapPriorYearApplied" value="yes"><span>Yes</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="unicapPriorYearApplied" value="no"><span>No</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="unicapPriorYearApplied" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label>
          </div>
          <p id="unicapHistoryNote" class="automatic-method-note"></p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden" id="unicapContinuityControls">
          <legend>Will this year's return use all the same UNICAP methods as last year? <button type="button" class="setup-help-link row-action-link row-definition-link" onmouseenter="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onmouseleave="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" onfocus="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onblur="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" data-definition-label="Why this matters" data-definition="A UNICAP calculation can contain several accounting-method choices. If every choice stays the same, UNIPRO carries the prior methods forward. If any choice changes, UNIPRO records both the prior method and the proposed method for that component." aria-describedby="selectionDefinitionTooltip">Why this matters</button></legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="unicapMethodContinuity" value="unchanged"><span>Yes, use the same methods</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="unicapMethodContinuity" value="changing"><span>No, one or more methods are changing</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="unicapMethodContinuity" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label>
          </div>
          <p id="unicapContinuityNote" class="automatic-method-note"></p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden" id="firstUnicapYearReasonControls">
          <legend>Why is this the first UNICAP year? <button type="button" class="setup-help-link row-action-link row-definition-link" onmouseenter="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onmouseleave="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" onfocus="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onblur="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" data-definition-label="Why this matters" data-definition="A new activity can generally select an initial permissible method. An activity that existed before but became subject to UNICAP, or should have applied UNICAP before, may also need beginning-inventory revaluation, Section 481(a), and Form 3115 support." aria-describedby="selectionDefinitionTooltip">Why this matters</button></legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="firstUnicapYearReason" value="newActivity"><span>The taxpayer newly started this trade or business; no tax method carries over</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="firstUnicapYearReason" value="newlySubject"><span>It existed last year and first became subject to UNICAP this year</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="firstUnicapYearReason" value="priorNoncompliance"><span>UNICAP may have been missed</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="firstUnicapYearReason" value="unsure"><span>Not sure</span></label>
          </div>
          <p id="firstUnicapYearNote" class="automatic-method-note"></p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden" id="unicapChangeComponentsControls">
          <legend>Which UNICAP methods are changing? <button type="button" class="setup-help-link row-action-link row-definition-link" onmouseenter="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onmouseleave="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" onfocus="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onblur="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" data-definition-label="What these choices mean" data-definition="Production method means the Simplified Production Method (SPM) or Modified Simplified Production Method (MSPM). Mixed service allocation means the method used to assign mixed service costs to inventory. MSPM mixed-service allocation means the method used under MSPM to allocate capitalizable mixed service costs between preproduction and production." aria-describedby="selectionDefinitionTooltip">What this means</button></legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="unicapChangeComponent" value="productionMethod"><span>Production calculation</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="unicapChangeComponent" value="mixedService"><span>Mixed service allocation</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="unicapChangeComponent" value="modifiedSplit"><span>MSPM mixed-service allocation</span></label>
          </div>
          <p class="small-note">If another accounting-method component is changing, document it in the separate method-change support.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden" id="priorAppliedMethodControls">
          <legend>Which production calculation did last year's return use?</legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorSelectedMethodChoice" value="SPM"><span>Simplified Production Method</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorSelectedMethodChoice" value="MSPM"><span>Modified Simplified Production Method</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden" id="priorMixedServiceMethodControls">
          <legend>How did last year's return allocate mixed service costs?</legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedServiceMethodChoice" value="labor"><span>Labor costs</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedServiceMethodChoice" value="production"><span>Production and business costs</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedServiceMethodChoice" value="direct"><span>Direct reallocation</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedServiceMethodChoice" value="step"><span>Step allocation</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedServiceMethodChoice" value="reasonable"><span>Other supported method</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedServiceMethodChoice" value="none"><span>No mixed service costs</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden" id="priorMixedMspmSplitMethodControls">
          <legend>How were capitalizable mixed service costs allocated under last year's MSPM? <button type="button" class="setup-help-link row-action-link row-definition-link" onmouseenter="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onmouseleave="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" onfocus="showDefinitionTooltip(this)" onblur="hideDefinitionTooltip(this)" data-definition-label="MSPM mixed-service allocation" data-definition="Under the Modified Simplified Production Method, capitalizable mixed service costs are allocated between preproduction and production. The permitted allocation methods use either direct material costs or preproduction labor costs." aria-describedby="selectionDefinitionTooltip">What this means</button></legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedSplitBasisChoice" value="materials"><span>Direct material costs</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="priorMixedSplitBasisChoice" value="labor"><span>Preproduction labor costs</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset id="srmEligibilityControls" class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden">
          <legend>Why is the property eligible for the Simplified Resale Method?</legend>
          <select id="srmEligibility">
            <option value="">Select eligibility</option>
            <option value="exclusive">The trade or business is exclusively engaged in resale activities</option>
            <option value="deMinimis">Production is de minimis and incident to resale activities</option>
            <option value="contract">Eligible property is produced under contract</option>
            <option value="ineligible">The property does not satisfy an SRM eligibility rule</option>
          </select>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset id="srmRatioModeControls" class="setup-question setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden">
          <legend>Which Simplified Resale Method absorption ratio applies?</legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="srmRatioMode" value="actual"><span>Actual current-year ratio</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="srmRatioMode" value="historic"><span>Historic absorption ratio</span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <div id="srmHistoricFields" class="setup-field wide conditional-setup hidden">
          <label for="srmHistoricRatio">Historic absorption ratio</label>
          <input id="srmHistoricRatio" type="text" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="5.0000%">
          <label for="srmHistoricSupport">Test-period and election support</label>
          <input id="srmHistoricSupport" placeholder="Workpaper reference and qualifying period">
        </div>
        <fieldset class="setup-question setup-field wide">
          <legend>Inventory valuation method</legend>
          <div class="binary-choice-grid">
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="inventoryMethod" value="FIFO"><span>FIFO</span></label>
            <label class="binary-choice"><input type="radio" name="inventoryMethod" value="LIFO"><span>LIFO</span></label>
          </div>
